"[B<-s >I<subject>] [B<-a >I<file ... >B<-->] I<to-addr ... >E<lt> message"
msgstr ""
"[B<-s >I<temat>] [B<-a >I<plik> ... B<-->] I<na-adres> ... E<lt> wiadomość"

